The dialog box part seems more useful. Possibly it could even be added
to the current wish parser. It's only useful when the expression doesn't
match too many objects, though.

OTOH, wishing is quite a powerful act, and you're supposed to think
before you do it. I usually look the spelling of stuff up in a spoiler
file, but a dialog box might make it a little more fair for unspoilt
players.

